     reference supplies the content, so it must not be reported as a link without a
     target (a shape earlier probes got wrong). -->
<topic id="g-link-no-target-edge">
  <title>xref through conref (boundary)</title>
  <body>
    <p><xref conref="lib.dita#lib3/xref1"/></p>
  </body>
</topic>
